<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 85,646 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 85,646 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 85,646 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 7 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Wednesday, compared to 40,094 tonnes on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>					    Wednesday	 Previous</p>
<p>    Export cargo			59,662	     6,921</p>
<p>    Import cargo			25,984	    33,986</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, two ships sailed and two berthed. In the next 24 hours, seven ships are expected to sail and 10 to arrive.</p>
</text>
